WEBVTT

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:05.270
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:07.400
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:10.150
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:11.990
Shining Finger

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:13.860
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:20.700
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:26.370
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:32.630
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.050
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:48.400
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.690
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:55.190
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.190 --> 00:00:58.280
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:02.290
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:04.040
Bright you now

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:08.540
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:10.880
Shining Finger

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:12.550
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:34.650
Domon Kasshu must now
bid farewell to Master Asia...

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:37.240
...and enter the final battle
against his teacher.

00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:39.910
But once again appearing
before him is the Devil Gundam.

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:42.030
That's right!

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:45.500
Domon's destiny has finally
come to a crossroads.

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:49.330
Does Domon have any
chance of winning...

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:52.610
...against this terrifying demon?

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:55.170
And now!

00:01:55.960 --> 00:02:00.220
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:06.310
Destined Battle!
Domon vs. Devil Gundam!

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:15.480
Huge energy flux detected
in South America!

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:17.940
Abnormal magnetism
and radiation detected!

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:19.860
Check one! Check two!

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:21.110
Amplify sensor readings!

00:02:21.110 --> 00:02:23.280
Roger!
Amplifying sensor readings!

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:25.030
They've confirmed it's
the Devil Gundam!

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:30.870
A-amazing...

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:35.210
This energy level is much greater
than the time in Shinjuku!

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:36.500
Moreover...

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:39.720
...that's the area where
Domon is training...

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:40.550
...to develop new skills!

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:42.800
Get Rain on the line for me.

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:45.010
We're having difficulty with
transmissions.

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:46.850
Communication is impossible!

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.100
In its present state...

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.140
...the Shining Gundam doesn't have
a chance against the Devil Gundam.

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:53.310
Let's deploy the God!

00:02:58.400 --> 00:02:59.780
What're you doing?

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:02.490
That was developed specifically
for the Final Battle.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:04.120
I'm altering its route.

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:08.200
Will you stop with this nonsense?!

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:11.710
Domon may already be making
his way to Neo Hong Kong.

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:15.370
What makes you think he's
still in the Guyana Highlands?

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:16.790
Well?

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:22.220
I suggest we wait until
we can contact Rain.

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:24.260
That would be more prudent.

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:28.100
But if Domon hasn't been
able to leave the area yet...

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:30.100
...he'll be very easy prey
for the Devil Gundam.

00:03:30.930 --> 00:03:34.340
If that were to happen, there'd
be no Final Battle for us.

00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:41.400
Feeling better?

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:43.610
Where am I?

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:45.280
Inside my transport plane.

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:47.990
Domon... Where's Domon?

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:50.370
He stayed behind.

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:51.700
What?!

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:01.130
I regret to say we won't be
turning back.

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:02.970
We must move swiftly
to Neo Hong Kong.

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:12.230
Domon...

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:25.700
Domon...

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:29.330
Do you expect to defeat me
with that level of fighting?

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:30.490
Yeah.

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:32.200
I'm no longer holding
anything back.

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:36.040
You can be sure that I'll defeat you!

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:43.010
What's wrong, Domon?!

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:50.100
Why not attack me with that
Super Mode of yours?

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:53.060
Or are you holding out on me?

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:58.020
Domon!

00:04:58.020 --> 00:05:00.150
I'll show you right here and now...

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:02.150
...what a genuine battle
is really like!

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:20.540
You fool!

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:23.050
Why did you come here
to train for all that time?!

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:25.050
You're finished!

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:27.590
What?

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:31.720
It's you again.

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:33.680
Gundam Spiegel!

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:38.850
Are you all right, Domon?

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:42.820
Can't you beat me without
the help of that guy?

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:45.940
Why, you!
Undefeated of the East!

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:46.780
You'll pay!

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:49.040
Ride this out, Domon!

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:50.110
Don't get angry over this.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:55.330
He's provoking you into using
the Super Mode with your anger.

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:56.450
Ride this out.

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:59.290
No. Get angry.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.040
You hate my guts, don't you?

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.250
Get mad. Get mad.

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:06.010
Get mad, get mad, get mad,
get mad!

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:09.760
Get mad. Get so mad,
it drives you mad!

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:11.550
Undefeated of the East!

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:12.430
Wait!

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:14.080
Calm down!

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:16.180
As long as you let others
stir up your feelings...

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:17.980
...you'll never become
a true Fighter.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:19.390
Nonsense!

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:21.150
Look to your past!

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:22.440
Think how many times...

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:25.070
...the energy from your anger
has led you to victory!

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:27.690
Undefeated of the East!

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:29.900
Well, look over there.

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:31.660
That person has appeared for you!

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.120
Kyoji!

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.260
Brothers of the same blood...

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:57.600
...can be so different in strength.

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:00.180
You shall recognize
your shortcomings...

00:07:00.180 --> 00:07:02.810
...and kneel before him.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:18.830
Kyoji... What's so funny?

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:21.790
What's so funny?!

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:25.460
Stop it, Domon!

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:28.420
I'll wipe him off the Earth
with my Super Mode!

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:31.380
I said you can't activate the
Super Mode with your anger!

00:07:31.670 --> 00:07:33.090
Out of my way!

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:35.390
You're well on your way,
Domon.

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:37.390
Get mad. Get mad!

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:38.640
Ride it out.

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:40.600
Control yourself, Domon!

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:49.780
They're gone.

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:50.780
Damn.

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:52.860
Never mind.

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:56.320
They can't escape the iron-fisted
grip of the Devil Gundam.

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:09.420
Hey, what's the big idea?

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:11.510
Calm down, Domon.

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:15.470
Your brother has been used as bait
in order to draw out your anger.

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:18.220
Even if he's being used as
bait or whatever...

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:20.680
...this is my battle!
Don't interfere!

00:08:21.220 --> 00:08:24.240
I'm saying you can't win with the
Super Mode activated by anger.

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:25.770
You don't know that!

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.060
Domon, listen!

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:27.900
I don't need your help!

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:29.150
You fool!

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:33.030
Can't you see through him?

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:37.200
Why do you think Master Asia
wants you to use the Super Mode?

00:08:37.960 --> 00:08:40.950
Anger causes one to lose his head.

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:45.190
This gives the enemy many
opportunities to attack.

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:48.460
That is why Master Asia
is targeting your anger.

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:52.920
I'm sure I heard this
voice somewhere.

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:55.340
It's a voice with warmth.

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:57.010
This voice...

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.890
Who is it?
Whose voice is this?

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:04.020
Retreat for now.

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:08.770
Isn't your goal to become champion
and to save your father?

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:12.730
That's why I have to defeat
the Devil Gundam now!

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:14.440
If I don't do it now...

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:16.950
...who knows when I'll
get another shot at Kyoji?!

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:20.240
You still won't listen to
what I'm telling you.

00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:26.790
A serene state of the mind.
Meikyo shisui.

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:30.250
Your soul must be tranquil
as a stream of water...

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:32.130
...and clear as a mirror.

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:35.050
It's the one thing you need
in order to win.

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:36.300
However...

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:38.720
...in your present state,
you couldn't do it.

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:41.970
Do as you wish!

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:43.390
Fight, if you insist on fighting!

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:44.810
I'm leaving!

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:50.150
In the unlikely event
you get out of here alive...

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:51.480
...I'll see you in Neo Hong Kong!

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:13.290
What?

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:14.380
You've got Rain on the line?

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.460
It's me! It's Rain!

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:19.880
Is it safe to have someone
from Neo Japan use our...

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:22.550
It won't take long.
I'll be accountable for it.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:26.060
Then you're saying that Domon's
still in the Guyana Highlands?

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:27.640
<i>Please hurry and save Domon!</i>

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:28.890
All right.

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:30.990
Commissioner Karato.

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:32.130
May we send it now?

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:33.900
Guess we've got no choice.

00:10:35.020 --> 00:10:35.940
Okay!

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:37.150
We are now deploying the God!

00:10:42.460 --> 00:10:44.370
We're counting on you,
God Gundam.

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:04.600
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:22.950
What's wrong?
Still afraid to come out?

00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:25.160
Domon Kasshu.

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:28.200
No matter where
you've disappeared to...

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:30.920
...you're destined to
face your ultimate fate.

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:31.960
Now come on out.

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:33.210
I'm right here!

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:41.420
All alone this time?

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:45.680
I take it you're ashamed of your
inability to fight on your own.

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:47.100
Shut up!

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:50.340
I'll get rid of you first
before I defeat Kyoji!

00:11:50.340 --> 00:11:51.850
Right.

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:54.650
There's no way a pupil can
defeat his own master!

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:55.900
Shut up!

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:57.190
I already told you!

00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:59.780
I'll never think of you
ever again as my master!

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:01.400
Undefeated of the East!

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:02.900
You fool!

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:16.080
I won't allow the likes of you
to talk to me like that!

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.340
You're too green for that!

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:28.260
There's nothing harder to stomach...

00:12:28.550 --> 00:12:30.520
...than an ignorant man who
fails to understand himself!

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:39.320
Why, you!

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:55.000
This appears to be the limit
of your strength as a Fighter.

00:12:57.670 --> 00:12:59.040
My great king!

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:02.800
Show some mercy on your
hopeless brother, Domon!

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:06.690
K-Kyoji...

00:13:18.350 --> 00:13:19.690
Wh-what's so funny?

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:21.570
What's so funny?!

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:25.190
Listen!

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:28.410
Mom's gone, and Dad's
been put in a cryogenic state!

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:31.490
I've been searching for you!

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:33.700
You have no right to laugh!

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:41.430
I will not forgive you!

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:45.260
I will crush you to pieces!

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:07.280
He's finally using it.
The Super Mode.

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:11.760
Kyoji!

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:35.260
Once again it seems
I read him accurately.

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:45.730
He's possessed by his own anger...

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:48.510
...and doing little more than
wasting his energy.

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:50.740
Now's my chance to attack.

00:15:00.760 --> 00:15:02.240
You're finished!

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:05.040
What?

00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:14.390
Schwarz!

00:15:15.620 --> 00:15:16.640
Domon...

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:35.990
It's Gundam Spiegel.

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:38.790
Schwarz...

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:41.160
You fool.

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:46.170
I warned you. Why did you
use your Super Mode?

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:49.130
I thought you gave up on me
and left.

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:52.130
I thought you'd regain your cool.

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:53.930
With no one to depend on...

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:57.100
...I thought you'd be more
cautious in your fighting.

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:00.140
I'm sorry.

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:02.250
I still don't have it together.

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:03.980
I didn't train enough.

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:08.860
You don't have it together!

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:10.570
You really don't have it together,
Domon!

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:14.030
You've been saved again
by the Gundam Spiegel.

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:17.950
You controlled your rage
but let your guard down.

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:20.580
Now let me finish you off!

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:23.670
Domon...

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.080
Remember!

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:26.960
That time.

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:30.510
That one moment
in the cave.

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:33.470
The instant you found your
Meikyo Shisui!

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:39.970
Dad...

00:16:40.380 --> 00:16:41.310
Mom...

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:43.730
I...!

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:45.190
...I...!

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:50.730
Domon...

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:52.900
...have peace in your heart
as you perish.

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:54.110
Perish?

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:55.450
Me?

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:57.820
I remember.

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:01.120
This is exactly the same
as that time.

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:11.100
Domon, you can't give up!

00:17:11.100 --> 00:17:12.130
You mustn't lose!

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:13.510
I see it!

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:14.630
Yes, I see it!

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:16.550
Each drop of water!

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:27.100
Don't you dare!

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:39.240
What's this energy?

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:42.370
He hasn't done anything
like this before!

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:43.200
Could he have...?!

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:20.490
You!

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:28.710
Domon!

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:29.920
You did it!

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:33.040
That is the true Super Mode!

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:34.370
Schwarz!

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:41.220
I see you've learned something.

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:44.680
However...

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:46.020
...don't get too confident!

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:02.120
What's going on?!
This is impossible!

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:03.570
Hijiuchi!

00:19:03.570 --> 00:19:04.870
Uraken! Seiken!

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:08.120
Why?!

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:10.120
How could I,
the Undefeated of the East...

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:13.130
...be powerless against you?!

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:14.880
I won't stand for it!

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:40.700
I-is he trying to surpass me?

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:51.210
Kyoji...

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:02.860
Kyoji, my brother...

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:05.010
I'm ending this right now.

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:07.240
With the King of Hearts!

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:10.680
Shining...

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:15.060
...Finger!

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:23.400
It's vanishing.

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:27.280
My anger and sorrow.
My revenge is vanishing.

00:20:53.430 --> 00:20:57.230
M-my... my Devil Gundam...

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:59.690
You don't know when to quit,
Master Asia.

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:09.240
Schwarz...

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:12.870
...if only you hadn't
gotten in my way.

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:15.870
You're embarrassing yourself,
Master Asia.

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:19.090
You've been defeated by
a former pupil of yours.

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:23.420
Why, you're...!

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:34.600
H-he can't be...!

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:52.660
It's over.

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:54.780
It's finally over.

00:22:07.720 --> 00:22:08.470
What's that?!

00:22:27.740 --> 00:22:32.370
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:32.740 --> 00:22:36.750
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:41.210
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:41.670 --> 00:22:44.750
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:45.050 --> 00:22:51.930
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:52.430 --> 00:22:57.640
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:57.850 --> 00:23:02.900
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:03.060 --> 00:23:09.450
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:09.820 --> 00:23:13.570
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:19.580
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:34.620 --> 00:23:36.510
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:36.510 --> 00:23:39.020
Domon has finally defeated
the Devil Gundam!

00:23:39.180 --> 00:23:41.640
However, Domon finds himself
in a pinch...

00:23:41.640 --> 00:23:45.150
...as the vicious Master Asia
knocks out the Shining Gundam!

00:23:45.150 --> 00:23:49.610
But Rain's prayers awaken
the most powerful of warriors!

00:23:50.450 --> 00:23:52.530
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.530 --> 00:23:56.330
Bright New Star!
The Birth of the God Gundam

00:23:53.990 --> 00:24:00.610
Bright New Star!
The Birth of the God Gundam

00:23:56.330 --> 00:23:58.620
Ready! Go!
